TITLE 1D transport with exchange
SOLUTION 0
    pH 7.0
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0
SOLUTION 1-10
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0
EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1-10
    Calcite 0 1
TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions flux flux
    -print_cells 1
    -print_frequency 1
END
